  m_text: "Dear Emma,\L\nHey there! I hope this letter finds you happy and doing
    well. It\u2019s been a while since we last talked, so I thought I\u2019d take
    a moment to write and catch up.\nThings on my end have been going pretty smoothly.
    Work has been keeping me busy, but I\u2019ve also been trying to make time for
    some fun\u2014reading a few good books and taking walks in the park. I\u2019ve
    been thinking about our last trip together and how much fun we had. It really
    made me miss spending time with you.\nHow have you been? How\u2019s everything
    going with your job and your family? I\u2019d love to hear all about what you\u2019ve
    been up to lately. Let me know if you\u2019ve discovered any new hobbies or gone
    on any adventures.\nLet\u2019s try not to let too much time pass before we talk
    again. Maybe we can plan a phone call soon, or even meet up if we can swing it.
    I really miss our chats.\nTake care of yourself, and write back when you get
    a chance. I\u2019d love to hear from you soon.\n\nWarmly,\LJohn"
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8f6a155106885004e9af427ebb177ee0, type: 2}
  m_sharedMaterial: {fileID: 471156319656653387, guid: 8f6a155106885004e9af427ebb177ee0, type: 2}
